      "content": "it’s just so quiet here. i keep thinking i hear his collar jingling in the hallway but then i remember he’s gone. the house feels so empty it actually hurts to breathe. i don't even know why i'm bothering to get up in the morning anymore. everything just feels so pointless without him.",
