    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's like the whole world is just moving on and doing nothing, while i'm just stuck in this silence. it feels so absurd. like, why am i even trying to go through the motions? people say \"it gets better\" but it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never coming back. it's just a lot of unnecessary struggle for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
